						<P CLASS="Texttable" STYLE="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;orphans:1;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:0;widows:1;margin-top:8pt;"><BR><BR>Up to 17,235,916 common shares (assuming the sale of 50% of the maximum number of common shares in this offering and no sale of any pre<FONT CLASS="nobreak">-funded</FONT> warrants but excluding the number of common shares issuable upon exercise of common warrants sold in this offering).</P>
					</TD>
