		</TABLE>
		<P CLASS="Text_ind" STYLE="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:8pt;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:24pt;widows:3;margin-top:8pt;">To the extent that our outstanding options, warrants or subscription investment units are exercised, investors in this offering may suffer additional dilution.</P>
		<P CLASS="Text_ind" STYLE="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:8pt;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:24pt;widows:3;margin-top:7pt;margin-top:7pt;">The total number of common shares reflected in the discussion and tables above are based on 10,714,171<FONT CLASS="nobreak"> </FONT>shares outstanding as of October<FONT CLASS="nobreak"> </FONT>13, 2023, assumes the exercise in full of the pre<FONT CLASS="nobreak">-funded</FONT> warrants, if any, and excludes the following:</P>
		<P CLASS="BL_m" STYLE="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;list-style-position:outside;list-style-type:disc;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:48pt;margin-right:0;margin-top:8pt;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-24pt;widows:3;margin-top:7pt;margin-top:7pt;"><FONT CLASS="bullet" STYLE="font-size:10pt;">&#x2022;<FONT STYLE="width: 27px;display: inline-block;">&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;</FONT></FONT>1,411,535 common shares issuable upon exercise of outstanding warrants at October<FONT CLASS="nobreak"> </FONT>13, 2023 with a weighted average exercise price of $18.44 per share;</P>
		<P CLASS="BL_m" STYLE="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;list-style-position:outside;list-style-type:disc;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:48pt;margin-right:0;margin-top:8pt;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-24pt;widows:3;margin-top:7pt;margin-top:7pt;"><FONT CLASS="bullet" STYLE="font-size:10pt;">&#x2022;<FONT STYLE="width: 27px;display: inline-block;">&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;</FONT></FONT>470,134 common shares reserved for issuance upon the exercise of outstanding stock options at October<FONT CLASS="nobreak"> </FONT>13, 2023 with a weighted average exercise price of $10.21&#x00a0;per share issued pursuant to our 2017 Stock Option Plan;</P>
		<P CLASS="BL_m" STYLE="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;list-style-position:outside;list-style-type:disc;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:48pt;margin-right:0;margin-top:8pt;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-24pt;widows:3;margin-top:7pt;margin-top:7pt;"><FONT CLASS="bullet" STYLE="font-size:10pt;">&#x2022;<FONT STYLE="width: 27px;display: inline-block;">&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;</FONT></FONT><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-3" STYLE="">391,305</FONT> common shares issuable upon exercise of warrants to be issued to the Placement Agent in connection with this offering based upon the sale of all of the securities offered hereby, and <FONT CLASS="CharOverride-3" STYLE="">39,131</FONT><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-3" STYLE=""> </FONT>common shares, <FONT CLASS="CharOverride-3" STYLE="">97,827</FONT><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-3" STYLE=""> </FONT>common shares,<FONT CLASS="CharOverride-3" STYLE=""> </FONT><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-3" STYLE="">195,653</FONT><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-3" STYLE=""> </FONT>common shares, and <FONT CLASS="CharOverride-3" STYLE="">293,479</FONT><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-3" STYLE=""> </FONT>common shares, assuming the sale of 10%, 25%, 50%, and 75% of the maximum amount, respectively; </P>
		<P CLASS="BL_m" STYLE="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;list-style-position:outside;list-style-type:disc;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:48pt;margin-right:0;margin-top:8pt;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-24pt;widows:3;margin-top:7pt;margin-top:7pt;"><FONT CLASS="bullet" STYLE="font-size:10pt;">&#x2022;<FONT STYLE="width: 27px;display: inline-block;">&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;</FONT></FONT><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-3" STYLE="">13,043,490</FONT> common shares issuable upon exercise of outstanding warrants sold in this offering, based upon the sale of all of the securities offered hereby, and <FONT CLASS="CharOverride-3" STYLE="">1,304,349</FONT><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-3" STYLE=""> </FONT>common shares, <FONT CLASS="CharOverride-3" STYLE="">3,260,873</FONT><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-3" STYLE=""> </FONT>common shares,<FONT CLASS="CharOverride-3" STYLE=""> </FONT><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-3" STYLE="">6,251,745</FONT><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-3" STYLE=""> </FONT>common shares, and <FONT CLASS="CharOverride-3" STYLE="">9,782,618</FONT><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-3" STYLE=""> </FONT>common shares, assuming the sale of 10%, 25%, 50%, and 75% of the maximum amount, respectively; and</P>
